"s":3,"p":[8,8],"r":[3,8],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Malachi iii. 8. Jerome's rendering is almost identical \"Si affiget homo Deum, quia vos configitis me,\" where the Douay version, strangely departs from the literal sense of the word and renders vaguely \"afflict.\" It is clear however that it was intended to be understood literally, as it is here taken by Cassian as a direct prophecy of the Crucifixion. The LXX. has πτερνιεῖ . The Hebrew word, which is only found again in Prov. xxii. 23, appears to mean \"defraud.\""},{"id":"d122c04bb948","v":"npnf.cassian.de_incarnatione","w":"cassian.de_incarnatione","a":"johannes_cassian","s":8,"p":[2,2],"r":[3,2],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Cf. Mal. iii. 2, 3."},{"id":"35cac12a3b8b","v":"npnf.cassian.de_incarnatione","w":"cassian.de_incarnatione","a":"johannes_cassian","s":8,"p":[8,8],"r":[3,8],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Mal. iii. 8."},{"id":"393efc32af10","v":"anf.tertullian.de_resurrectione","w":"tertullian.de_resurrectione","a":"tertullian","s":23,"p":[0,0],"r":[3,23],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Mal. iv. 5.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"805bd2f6ff16","v":"anf.tertullian.de_resurrectione","w":"tertullian.de_resurrectione","a":"tertullian","s":32,"p":[0,0],"r":[3,20],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Mal. iv. 2, 3.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"326c117f1a0b","v":"anf.tertullian.adversus_marcionem","w":"tertullian.adversus_marcionem","a":"tertullian","s":3,"p":[45,45],"r":[1,10],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Mal. i. 10, 11."},{"id":"0e55d6be0094","v":"anf.tertullian.adversus_marcionem","w":"tertullian.adversus_marcionem","a":"tertullian","s":4,"p":[2,2],"r":[1,10],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Mal. i. 10, 11."},{"id":"bc923eabaec3"